**First Image (`Screenshot 2026-09-24 020841.png`):**
![cetearing variable](screenshort/one.png.png)
This image handles the **Clear/Reset Functionality** (`button4_Click`). When this button is clicked, it clears the text from all four input text boxes (`txtdayoftheweek`, `txtmonthtext`, `txtdayofmonth`, and `txtyeartext`) and resets the output label (`dateoutputlabel`) to empty spaces so the user can start over.

**Second Image 
![display output](screenshort/tow.png.png)
This image handles the **Data Processing & Display Functionality** (`button3_Click`). When clicked, it captures the user inputs from the four text boxes, assigns them to string variables, concatenates them into a single formatted date string (`showdata`), and displays the result in the output label (`dateoutputlabel`).